# Project context

At the start of work in this repo, read and use:

1. **agents.md** — Repository agent index: rules (`.dev/rules/`), architecture (`.dev/docs/architecture.md`), current mission (`.dev/specs/`), session memory (`.dev/memory.md`), skills (`.dev/skills/`).
2. **claude.md** — Claude-specific pointers to the above.
3. **gemini.md** — Gemini-specific pointers to the above.

Follow the conventions and current mission referenced there.
